":"rgb(38, 38, 38)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"A","cls":"site-button neuro-button","text":"Book Combo Package","x":39,"y":4875.453125,"w":243,"h":53,"font":"900 14px / 16.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"900","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"11px 29px","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","background":"rgb(133, 92, 172)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"","text":"I didn't find this\nin a book. I found\nit in the hardest\nyears of my life","x":14,"y":5097.453125,"w":406,"h":160,"font":"700 36px / 40px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 35px -2px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"I built a successful international career at the United Nations — working alongside diplomats, leading people across different cultures, and changing my career ","x":16,"y":5292.453125,"w":398,"h":100,"font":"14px / 20px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 14px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"And it was. I also had a husband I love, two children growing up too fast, and aging parents who needed me. Every role I played, I gave it everything. What I di","x":16,"y":5406.453125,"w":398,"h":100,"font":"14px / 20px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 14px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"That's when I stopped looking for a better strategy and started understanding how my brain actually works. That search led me to neuroscience — and changed ever","x":16,"y":5520.453125,"w":398,"h":60,"font":"14px / 20px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 14px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H3","cls":"","text":"I was doing everything right.\nAnd I still felt completely lost.","x":16,"y":5628.453125,"w":398,"h":48,"font":"700 20px / 24px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-0.7px","margin":"48px 0px 25px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"That's the moment I understand better than any theory. It's not about not trying hard enough. It's about running a system that was never designed for this much ","x":16,"y":5701.453125,"w":398,"h":80,"font":"14px / 20px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 14px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"","text":"The method based on the NeuroIntegration method by Katerina Lengold","x":19,"y":6359.453125,"w":398,"h":72,"font":"700 20px / 24px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 61px 3px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(38, 38, 38)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"The NeuroIntegration method was developed by Katerina Lengold, founder of the California Institute of Neurointegration.","x":16,"y":6492.453125,"w":398,"h":63,"font":"15px / 21px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 15px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"It combines neuroscience, psychology, and behavioural science into a practical coaching framework that works with how your brain is actually wired. NeuroSprints","x":16,"y":6570.453125,"w":398,"h":105,"font":"15px / 21px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 15px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"LI","cls":"","text":"ACT · NEUROSPRINT\nUse neuroscience-informed planning cycles to reach goals without burnout.","x":16,"y":7143.03125,"w":398,"h":68,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"LI","cls":"","text":"THINK · NEUROSURFING\nRewire habitual thought patterns, reduce cognitive rigidity, and build creative thinking.","x":16,"y":7235.03125,"w":398,"h":68,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"LI","cls":"","text":"FEEL · NEUROBALANCE\nTrain your nervous system to recover faster from stress and stay emotionally balanced.","x":16,"y":7327.03125,"w":398,"h":68,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"","text":"Is this you?\nYou might be in the right place if...","x":16,"y":7537.03125,"w":398,"h":48,"font":"700 20px / 24px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 35px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(38, 38, 38)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You're exhausted but can't slow down\nYou keep pushing through — but the energy just isn't there anymore.","x":16,"y":7620.03125,"w":398,"h":81,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"12px 22px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You're facing a big change\nNew country, new role, new chapter — and you don't know where to start.","x":16,"y":7714.03125,"w":398,"h":81,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"12px 22px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You feel stuck but don't know why\nYou've tried changing things — jobs, habits, routines. Nothing fully clicks.","x":16,"y":7808.03125,"w":398,"h":81,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"12px 22px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You've been putting yourself last\nEveryone else comes first. You've lost track of what you actually want.","x":16,"y":7902.03125,"w":398,"h":81,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"12px 22px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You know you're capable of more\nBut something keeps getting in the way — and you're ready to find out what.","x":16,"y":7996.03125,"w":398,"h":81,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"12px 22px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You're doing everything right — still feel empty\nOn paper it looks good. Inside, something is missing.","x":16,"y":8090.03125,"w":398,"h":76,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"12px 22px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"site-section-title","text":"Reviews","x":16,"y":8279.03125,"w":398,"h":36.71875,"font":"700 36px / 36.72px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 39px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"Working with Ksenia helped me understand the real reasons behind my procrastination. I became more self-aware and grateful. I feel calmer now, and my anxiety ha","x":40,"y":8473.75,"w":223,"h":160.1875,"font":"12px / 16px Lato, Arial, sans-s